                                "sense_id": "3b5ae369-70ed-343f-881a-cecba2471d32",
                                "text": "Coordinate term: bailey"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "468131b7-1448-482e-8c54-2bbb1b94e2f0",
                                "sense_id": "3b5ae369-70ed-343f-881a-cecba2471d32",
                                "text": "\"Birds are dinosaurs\" is the bailey; \"birds are more similar to dinosaurs than anything else\" is the motte."
